			"date": "2026-06-10T16:31:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Not knowing the difficulty of porting your tests to the built-in harness, that’s what I’d look at first. External dependencies are more and more problematic, and it seems crazy to drop support for older versions in production to accommodate a test harness. My 2 cents</p>",
