			"date": "2026-06-10T16:42:15.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Either \"upgrade and pray\" or bump a major.</p><p>Node 18 and 20 are EOL, just stop caring about them.</p><p>Or you could migrate to Node's built-in test runner as that's a good choice overall and will save you that question in the future; depends what it costs you.</p>",
